flowchart TD
    m_end_return_it[Return it]
    m_start(Receive call)
    m_start --> m_step_1
    m_step_1["STEP 1: Is it a transaction in the mempool, coherent with the snapshot?"]
    m_step_1 --> |Yes| m_end_return_it
    m_step_1 --> |No| m_step_2
    m_step_2["STEP 2: Does the FINALIZED store hold the height?"]
    m_step_2 --> |Yes| m_end_return_it
    m_step_2 --> |No| m_step_3
    m_step_3["STEP 3: Does the chain head hold it (best chain, or a retained branch where acceptable)?"]
    m_step_3 --> |Yes| m_end_return_it
    m_step_3 --> |No| m_step_4
    m_step_4["STEP 4: Is it in the gap between them, available from the validator (passthrough)?"]
    m_step_4 --> |Yes| m_end_return_it
    m_step_4 --> |No| m_end_return_none
    m_end_return_none[Return None]
